WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.200
A barn wall with seven painted panels.

2
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.640
In front, a line of animals, all the same.

3
00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.720
Then small things appear beside the pigs.

4
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:10.680
A bed.

5
00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.570
A ribbon.

6
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:12.520
A bottle.

7
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.450
An apple.

8
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.610
A bucket.

9
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.720
Now the line of animals
stands in two groups.

10
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.840
They started out as equals.

11
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.950
So when did the pigs stop being equal?

12
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.160
In this mission, you'll hear Old
Major's warnings about human habits,

13
00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.170
and turn them into a checklist.

14
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.720
You'll put the pigs' privileges
in the order they really happen.

15
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:35.930
And you'll see how power
is held: through fear,

16
00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.120
knowledge and propaganda.

17
00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:42.050
Your mission: work out when
the pigs stop being equal.
